  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ac5a93cd7b7b2a0468a50929d71f9a79, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textDisplay: {fileID: 1987001048}
  lines:
  - The world was once safeguarded by three Elemental Spirits
  - guardians of Water, Fire, and Earth.
  - Through them, life endured, and balance held firm across every land.
  - But now, the harmony they forged begins to crumble.
  - The elements twist against their nature
  - and the world trembles under the weight of chaos.
  - And in the heart of this collapse, a young girl falls ill.
  - "His little sister\u2026 drained by a sickness born from the world\u2019s unraveling."
  - In the darkness, a lone figure emerges.
  - "A hooded stranger who whispers: \u2018Gather the elemental power\u2026 and you
    will save your sister.\u2019"
  - "His words carry promise\u2026 yet hide unspoken truths."
  - For even a path of salvation can be shaped by shadows.
  - And so, guided by hope and a dangerous misunderstanding, he steps forward.
  - "A journey begins \u2014 one that will decide the fate of every living soul."
  - 
  currentLineIndex: -1
